  "assumptions": [
   "Power target: about 3000 per arm to detect 0.1 at 80% power; the observed Message 15 by Republican interaction was 0.165 (SE 0.057), and interaction contrasts need about 4 times the main-effect n, so it is sized to an MDE near 0.1. Total N about 12000.",
   "To keep four arms, Message 20 is tested only under forced exposure; the feed contrast is tested for Message 15 only.",
   "Sampling is stratified by party, with Republicans at about half the sample; Lucid panel; the interaction is pre-registered as the primary test."
  ],
  "unresolved": [
   "The actual Message 15 and 20 video files and the simulated feed must be produced by the research team.",
   "IRB number and compensation to be supplied."
